Longlist,79,A,Safety,,Universiti Teknologi Malaysia (UTM),Bachelor of Engineering (Biomedical) with Honours,Malaysia,Johor Bahru (Skudai),"QS Engineering & Technology #86 world (2026, up from #102) - Malaysia's BEST engineering subject rank, ahead of UM",QS ~#158-181 world,A-Level accepted (listed explicitly as a direct-entry qualification). General entry is modest; local route via UPU. Programme code SEBB-01.,A*A*A*A (predicted),Yes,MUET Band 2 minimum for Malaysian students (official page). He has NOT sat MUET.,,MYR 5000 (ESTIMATE - local UPU subsidised rate; verify),MYR 20000 (ESTIMATE),MYR 15000,4,"80,000.00","Affordable WITHOUT any scholarship. Optional: JPA, Yayasan Khazanah, Petronas, UTM merit awards. admission.utm.my",,,,n/a - Malaysian citizen,n/a - home country. NO migration pathway; intent_to_migrate=true unmet.,"CONFIRMED official (UTM programme page): accredited by 'Malaysian Qualification Agency Engineering Accreditation Council' = EAC -> BEM -> Ir. PLOs are written in Washington Accord language ('complex engineering problems', WK1-WK9).",UPU (public university central application),2027-03-31 (ESTIMATE - UPU window; verify),2027 Oct (Malaysian public AY),"The strongest MY row on ENGINEERING reputation specifically: QS Eng&Tech #86 beats UM, even though UM wins on overall rank (#58). Ladder is textbook-confirmed on UTM's own page - accreditor named as Engineering Accreditation Council AND the PLOs use the exact Washington Accord tell-tale wording ('complex engineering problems', WK1-WK9) that the workflow says to look for. 138 credit hours, 4 yrs, full-time. scholarship_opportunity 5 = affordability, not award odds (see UM note; agreed with student 2026-07-16). post_study_work_fit 1 - home country, no migration route. Fees ESTIMATED; verify at Stage 4. Skudai/JB is the farthest MY campus from Langkawi - 'Near family' only weakly satisfied, hence location_pref_fit 4 not 5.",https://fke.utm.my/biomedical/bachelor-of-engineering-bio-medical-2/,Not verified
