sation is completed at Clayton, and transfer needs WAM >= 50%. Official 2026 tuition: Yrs1-2 RM54,720/yr at the Malaysian-citizen local rate (auto 10% bursary waiver -> ~RM49,248/yr); Yrs3-4 Clayton AUD59,600/yr international. Recomputed all-in ~RM714,000 (tuition w/ waiver ~RM469k + living ~RM245k @ AUD3.1) = ~RM214k OVER his RM500k budget -> scholarship gate NOT moot here (scholarship_opportunity 3). 6% SST on private-uni tuition (from 1 Jul 2025) applies to INTERNATIONAL students; as a Malaysian citizen on the local rate he is exempt. Still ~RM330k cheaper than straight Monash Australia (RM1,044,080) for the SAME Clayton degree + SAME 485 outcome = best value-for-migration row on his list. Final award = Monash Australia degree -> Engineers Australia (Professional Engineer) + EAC Malaysia + Washington Accord -> BEM (Ir.). Correction: the RM8,000/yr UEC-only waiver noted at Stage 3 is separate; the 10% bursary here is the general biomedical waiver, open to A-Level students. Dossier built 2026-07-25.",https://www.monash.edu.my/study/undergraduate/engineering/bachelor-of-biomedical-engineering-honours,Official page
